'''May''' (Japanese: '''ハルカ''' ''Haruka'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 2 random Pokémon from your deck into your hand. For each Pokémon you put into your hand this way, choose a Pokémon to shuffle from your hand into your deck.
}}

